connections and all this,

00:37:28.200 --> 00:37:30.300
and we've got a, I
think, on the tech thing

00:37:30.300 --> 00:37:32.850
also just be thinking about
in lots of discussions,

00:37:32.850 --> 00:37:35.730
we've had discussions about
palliative kind of life care.

00:37:35.730 --> 00:37:37.590
Yes, they had a really
good session on frailty,

00:37:37.590 --> 00:37:40.350
we were talking about
neighbourhoods, urgent care pathway,

00:37:40.350 --> 00:37:42.150
all these things are connected.

00:37:42.150 --> 00:37:44.790
And in the discussion
yesterday on frailty,

00:37:44.790 --> 00:37:47.370
we've got quite oddly deep into things

00:37:47.370 --> 00:37:49.140
like comprehensive geriatric assessment,

00:37:49.140 --> 00:37:50.970
which is a very robust process,

00:37:50.970 --> 00:37:53.130
still largely paper-driven,

00:37:53.130 --> 00:37:55.980
and can take our clinical
staff ages to do.

00:37:55.980 --> 00:37:58.050
So first of all, it can be automated,

00:37:58.050 --> 00:37:59.580
and secondly, it can be moved upstream,

00:37:59.580 --> 00:38:01.170
thirdly, and be moved out of hospital

00:38:01.170 --> 00:38:02.130
