00:38:02.130 --> 00:38:03.120
So there's some stuff there

00:38:03.120 --> 00:38:05.340
that I think we're just
in all this stuff needed,

00:38:05.340 --> 00:38:07.710
try and connect the big ideas of tech

00:38:07.710 --> 00:38:10.350
into the real life of what's going to,

00:38:10.350 --> 00:38:12.060
