00:38:12.060 --> 00:38:13.560
and care better, et cetera.

00:38:13.560 --> 00:38:15.240
So that feels like we're
starting to get there

00:38:15.240 --> 00:38:16.890
but we're still a lot to do.

00:38:16.890 --> 00:38:18.990
Then the second thing was
