- Okay, thank you David.

00:45:12.360 --> 00:45:16.050
So what I might do is
take all the questions,

00:45:16.050 --> 00:45:17.370
and then we'll come back to you.

00:45:17.370 --> 00:45:19.586
So, Louise.

00:45:19.586 --> 00:45:20.636
- Yeah, thanks David.

00:45:21.750 --> 00:45:24.600
And yeah, you know some
really good things in here,

00:45:24.600 --> 00:45:25.467
well done to the, you know,

00:45:25.467 --> 00:45:27.780
you and colleagues in the whole system,

00:45:27.780 --> 00:45:29.280
talks about ambulance response times,

00:45:29.280 --> 00:45:30.330
people off the waiting list.

00:45:30.330 --> 00:45:31.560
Also people being able to see

00:45:31.560 --> 00:45:33.210
