00:45:40.080 --> 00:45:41.550
particularly for women.

00:45:41.550 --> 00:45:43.140
And if I look at,

00:45:43.140 --> 00:45:44.790
obviously prevention's a key factor there,

00:45:44.790 --> 00:45:47.700
but if you also look at
long-term condition management

00:45:47.700 --> 00:45:52.397
and things like the diabetes
