I wondered, Claire,

00:55:44.130 --> 00:55:45.240
is that an area you'd like to cover?

00:55:45.240 --> 00:55:47.116
- Yeah, I mean Amanda's covered
some of the points here.

00:55:47.116 --> 00:55:48.570
I mean it's important that this data

