people that need it.

00:56:32.010 --> 00:56:34.221
But I completely agree with you,

00:56:34.221 --> 00:56:35.054
we've got a lot more to do,

00:56:35.054 --> 00:56:36.330
but the focus should be diabetes

00:56:36.330 --> 00:56:37.680
